## 6. Caveats
Not researched (so no claims): Klotski, DAOP, EdgeMoE, SwapMoE, SiDA, PowerInfer(-2), MoE-Lightning, AdapMoE, ExpertFlow, ik_llama.cpp internals, KTransformers internals beyond background knowledge. Compute time c = 0.05-0.10 s is an assumption. Layer-time/overlap analysis assumes the shared expert GPU split can run concurrently with the blocking fill, which is unverified in our scheduler.

