+Save each submitted job ID and use `$Q wait JOB_ID --timeout 900` (180 for probe) before the next submission. Stop after a failed status, watchdog trip or invalid measurements; diagnose rather than adding parameter sweeps. No trace is enabled; existing J-OM14 traced totals are mechanism clues only. If runs 1/2 differ in output or decode by >5%, the wrapper refuses to call that prompt-only evidence: keep default off and treat the campaign as inconclusive, with fewer than six runs. Optionally inspect the policy **without launching a GPU job** after run 4:
