- **Q1:** Default offload uses the ubatch token count: prefill ≥32 may run expert `MUL_MAT_ID` on GPU; one-token decode remains CPU. Normal routed splits upload the **selected expert union**, grouped by consecutive IDs—typically three copies per group across up/gate/down—not unconditionally all 256. Destination allocation remains full-sized; unmatched callbacks can fall back to whole-tensor copying. See [threshold logic](/home/muk/projects/xs-dev/llama-place/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/ggml-cuda.cu:6385) and [selective copying](/home/muk/projects/xs-dev/llama-place/src/llama-context.cpp:3662).
